          "concern": "DB-view category and lookup names can hide distinct native identity and not-found contracts.",
          "response": "The rs=me patch reuses full Bug1801529 with no separate Phabricator review. Annotation lint does not prove getter prose or caller behavior.",
          "applied": "Full retained documentation changes identify native types and add the unused _aFolderIsComingBack formal parameter to the no-op listener method. A single-folder view can be a one-folder virtual search; a multi-folder category also includes search views. Current getSortType returns undefined for absent sort columns. Row lookup checks the header folder before a key-only native lookup; Message-ID lookup instead returns the first matching backing-database header or null and does not prove visibility or uniqueness.",
